<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ /** @var array<string,int> $dash */
/** @var array<string,mixed> $scheduler */ /** @var bool $schedulerHealthy */ /** @var bool $canManage */ /** @var bool $canPrices */ use Vertex\Core\View;
$sel = static fn (string $a, string $b): string => $a === $b ? ' selected' : '';
$tiles = ['upcoming' => 'Expiring in 30 days', 'awaiting_review' => 'Awaiting Admin review', 'approved' => 'Approved, no invoice yet', 'outstanding_invoices' => 'Outstanding invoices', 'paid_unconfirmed' => 'Paid, not yet confirmed', 'overdue' => 'Paid but past expiry', 'expired' => 'Expired', 'recent' => 'Renewed (30 days)', 'on_hold' => 'On hold']; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Services</p><h1>Domains &amp; hosting</h1></div>
    <div class="actions"><?php if ($canManage) : ?><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/renewals/new">Add a service</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/renewals/export?<?= e(http_build_query($qs)) ?>">Export CSV</a><?php endif; ?><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/renewals/prices">Price list</a></div></div>
<?php if (!$schedulerHealthy) : ?><div class="alert alert-error" role="status"><p><strong>Reminders are not running.</strong> <?= $scheduler['at'] === null ? 'The scheduled task has never run.' : 'The scheduled task last ran ' . (int) $scheduler['hours'] . ' hours ago.' ?> Stages, reminders and expiry marking only happen when the cron job runs <code>php bin/console.php schedule:run</code> (see the deployment guide).</p></div>
<?php else : ?><p class="muted">Scheduled task last ran <?= e(local_time($scheduler['at'])) ?><?= $scheduler['ok'] ? '' : ' (with errors: check the logs)' ?>.</p><?php endif; ?>
<div class="stat-grid"><div class="stat"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) $dash['total'] ?></span><span class="stat-l">Services (not cancelled)</span></div>
    <?php foreach ($tiles as $k => $l) : ?><a class="stat" href="/renewals?bucket=<?= e($k) ?>"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash[$k] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l"><?= e($l) ?></span></a><?php endforeach; ?></div>
<form method="get" action="/renewals" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="Reference, name, provider, client" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="t">Type</label><select id="t" name="type"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('renewals.types') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['type'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="s">Status</label><select id="s" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('renewals.statuses') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['status'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="from">Expires from</label><input id="from" name="from" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['from']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">Expires to</label><input id="to" name="to" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['to']) ?>"></div>
    <?php if ($filters['bucket'] !== '') : ?><input type="hidden" name="bucket" value="<?= e($filters['bucket']) ?>"><?php endif; ?><div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Service</th><th>Client</th><th>Type</th><th>Provider</th><th>Expires</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <?php foreach ($rows as $r) : ?><tr><td><a href="/renewals/<?= e($r['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($r['identifier']) ?></strong></a><br><span class="muted"><?= e($r['reference']) ?></span></td><td><?= e($r['client_name']) ?></td><td><?= e(config("renewals.types.{$r['service_type']}", $r['service_type'])) ?></td><td><?= e($r['provider']) ?></td>
        <td><?= e(local_date($r['expires_on'])) ?><br><span class="muted"><?= (int) $r['days_left'] < 0 ? e((string) abs((int) $r['days_left'])) . ' days ago' : e((string) (int) $r['days_left']) . ' days left' ?></span></td><td><?= View::partial('rbadge', ['s' => $r['status']]) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
    <?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="6" class="muted">No services match.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
